flowchart  LR
%% the daemon start, typed quickly
   start([crystalline serve])  -->   lock{Instance lock free?}
	lock -->|no|  attach[Talk to the running daemon]
	lock -->|yes| load[Load config and overlay]   
   load --> open[(Open the store)]
      open --> syncAll[Startup sync of every domain]
   syncAll -->  serve[Serve socket, MCP and HTTP]
%% the poller starts last
   serve --> poller[Origin poller]
